      "text": "A grouped bar chart titled \"EPI: DPT-HepB-Hib 1 and 3 coverage by orgunit - last year\", 2016, with coverage (%) for twelve districts sorted by DPT-HepB-Hib 1 coverage, which is labelled on each bar: Bird 33.5, Dessert 67.1, Sweet 74.7, Staple 76.4, Fish 82.8, Insect 83.4, Cat 83.7, Game 84.5, Fruit 89.7, Dinner 90.5, Dog 91.9 and Vegetable 96.9. The DPT-HepB-Hib 3 bar is lower than the DPT-HepB-Hib 1 bar in every district; its values are not labelled.",
